{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108305","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108305","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710830501:1":{"text":"隊長、戻られたのですね！お水をどうぞ！","source_cn":"队长！您回来了！快，这边有水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4450DF1A27C2372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710830502:1":{"text":"もうずっと戦いっぱなしではないですか。今すぐ休んでください！","source_cn":"您已经连续战斗太久了，必须马上休息一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F3D54B2F4CB618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830503:1":{"text":"そうですよ、隊長。後は我々に任せて、あなたは――","source_cn":"是啊，队长。剩下的交给属下吧，您——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85889866E658D0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710830504:1":{"text":"グウィネス隊長！ただ今応援に参りました！","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！那个……我们来支援了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B5DBC9B35F267E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830505:1":{"text":"あの、僕を覚えていますか？宮廷魔術師のダリーです。","source_cn":"您还记得我吗？我是宫廷法师达利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75BF5D0B781CB578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830506:1":{"text":"もちろんです。あなたが提供してくれた手がかりは、とても有用でした。","source_cn":"当然，您提供的线索帮助了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF15CAB133210720A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710830507:1":{"text":"へへ、それは良かった……あっ、彼女は相方のディーズです。","source_cn":"嘿嘿，那就好。哦，对，这位是我的搭档迪兹","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E678951D9BEB95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710830508:1":{"text":"お会いできて光栄です。グウィネス隊長。","source_cn":"向您致敬，格温妮丝队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D23E15EDB290CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710830509:1":{"text":"こちらこそ、ディーズさん。","source_cn":"日安，魔法师迪兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF215FD09653889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710830510:1":{"text":"早速ですが、私から提案があります。現状、物理的な防衛線だけでは、ここにいる人たちを守り切るのは困難です。","source_cn":"您好，我有一个提议——依照目前的局势，仅靠物理防线很难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01683AD892056A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710830511:1":{"text":"ですから、劇場の周りを強力な魔法バリアで覆ってはどうでしょう？","source_cn":"不知能否在剧场区域张开保护性极强的魔导屏障？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B76E3ED24594987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710830512:1":{"text":"そうそう！魔物の侵入も防げますし、バリアの中なら安全です！","source_cn":"对对对！那里面绝对安全！魔物很难越过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4A6CB4EB1A5FDFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710830513:1":{"text":"そしていただけると助かります。","source_cn":"那真是帮大忙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C3D9F8FAB5597E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710830514:1":{"text":"マーチン、カレイス、直ちに皆さんを劇場の中央へ集めてください。ディーズさんたちがバリアを展開します！","source_cn":"马丁，加雷斯，立刻组织民众向剧场中心集合，配合两位魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x891173F5636FB1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"守備軍のマーチン","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军加雷斯":{"text":"守備軍のカレイス","source":"守备军加雷斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宫廷魔法师达利":{"text":"宮廷魔術師のダリー","source":"宫廷魔法师达利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宫廷魔法师迪兹":{"text":"宮廷魔術師のディーズ","source":"宫廷魔法师迪兹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":5}}